meta {
  name: Failure Modes
  seq: 9
}

docs {
  Negative-path tests for auth, admin, org, credentials, webhook, and signal endpoints.
  Credential failures: empty raw_creds, invalid format, missing exchange (Indian), verify invalid format (hint).
  Webhook failures: immutable field on PUT, paused webhook, suspended account/org, invalid_symbol (forex on Indian cred), signal dedup replay.
  Run after the happy-path requests in each folder.
  Ops runbook: docs/operations-security.md (rotate-token, suspend, dedup incidents).
}
